<title>CANADA: Canada July manufacturers' shipments rise 3.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada July manufacturers' shipments rise 3.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian manufacturers' shipments rose 3.0 percent in July to C$34.36 billion seasonally adjusted from an upwardly revised C$33.35 billion in June, Statistics Canada said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				  Month pct	Total</p>
<p>   New Orders		 +3.7	    C$34.60 bln</p>
<p>   Unfilled orders	  +0.7	    C$34.39 bln</p>
<p>   Inven (owned)	    -0.4	    C$44.44 bln</p>
<p>				  July	    June</p>
<p>   Inven to shipments     1.29	    1.34</p>
</text>
